## 5. Room-related data

**Existing room support:**

- **StudentClass table:** `RoomID` (string, max 32) – in migration and `StudentClass` fillable
- **Frontend:** `room_id` / `RoomID` used in SmartCalendar.vue

**SmartCalendar.vue** (lines 1021–1048):

```1021:1048:frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
    const rooms = [...new Set(teacherCourses.map(c => c.room_id || c.RoomID).filter(Boolean))];
    return {
      ...t,
      roomLabel: rooms.length > 0 ? `教室 ${rooms.join(', ')}` : '',
      roomIds: rooms
    };
  ...
const allRoomOptions = computed(() => {
  const roomSet = new Set();
  courses.value.forEach(c => {
    const rid = c.room_id || c.RoomID;
    if (rid) roomSet.add(String(rid));
  });
  return Array.from(roomSet).sort();
});
```

**Sync payload** (line 1248):

```javascript
room_id: c.RoomID || c.room_id || ''
```

**Backend:**

- `StudentClass` model fillable includes `RoomID`
- `StudentClassController` update validates `RoomID`
- Import/Export maps `room_id` ↔ `RoomID`
- Default `RoomID = '1'` when not provided
- `schedules` table has no `room_id` column; room info comes from `student-classes` (StudentClass.RoomID)

---

